            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, justice Breyer questioned whether an exception could allow recovery for conduct occurring before the 300\u2011day period."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c6364c1afb6da2c60a7725c342406a23d1b6c2e6fcdd4d8d317dc4c40c58016c",
