          "text": "According to Roy T. Englert, Jr. (Petitioner), according to Roy T. Englert, Jr. (Petitioner), there is a lopsided circuit split; the First Circuit\u2019s Sabree decision, which cuts off damages at 300\u202fdays, aligns with our position."
